@startuml
title Smart Shopping - Proposed Kubernetes Deployment (Not Yet Running)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
node "Shopper Browser" as Browser
node "Kubernetes Cluster / smart-shopping namespace" {
 node "Ingress Controller\nTLS" as Ingress
 node "Frontend Deployment\n2 proposed replicas" as Frontend
 node "Frontend Service" as FES
 node "API Deployment\n2-3 proposed replicas" as API
 node "API Service" as APIS
 node "Price Import CronJob\nconcurrencyPolicy: Forbid" as Import
 node "Carbon-Aware Forecast CronJob\nconcurrencyPolicy: Forbid" as Forecast
 database "PostgreSQL 16\nStatefulSet + PVC (demo)" as DB
 node "Prometheus and Grafana\nPrivate metrics" as Monitor
 node "ConfigMap + Kubernetes Secrets" as Config
}
cloud "Approved CSV / API" as Provider
cloud "Simulated Grid Signal" as Signal
Browser --> Ingress : HTTPS
Ingress --> FES
FES --> Frontend
Frontend --> APIS : JSON API
APIS --> API
API --> DB : Price and forecast queries
Import --> Provider : Read prices
Import --> DB : Validated upsert
Forecast --> Signal : Read intensity
Forecast --> DB : Due jobs and forecasts
API ..> Monitor
Import ..> Monitor
Forecast ..> Monitor
Config ..> API
Config ..> Forecast
note right of Forecast
  24h deadline override is enforced by persisted state.
  CronJob scheduling alone is not a carbon policy.
end note
@enduml
